WEBVTT

00:11:27.224 --> 00:11:31.311
with complex problems coming at us
quickly and constantly.

00:11:32.062 --> 00:11:37.109
We need to tap into everyone's
knowledge and creativity.

00:11:39.069 --> 00:11:41.071
Labels and hierarchies,

00:11:41.071 --> 00:11:43.782
hiding information, consolidating power,

00:11:43.824 --> 00:11:46.869
being unkind or pretend kind.

00:11:47.828 --> 00:11:51.665
That's not going to help us do
what we need to

00:11:51.707 --> 00:11:53.417
to create a better future.

00:11:55.335 --> 00:11:58.046
So when I now ask you,

00:11:58.046 --> 00:11:59.631
who's in charge,

00:11:59.631 --> 00:12:01.300
who’s the leader today?